 </details>
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
\begin_inset Formula $\ket{\psi}=\ket{0}$
\end_inset


\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset

#+html:
 <details><summary>Show/hide solution...</summary>We write 
\begin_inset Formula $\ket{\psi}$
\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathbf{Z}$
\end_inset

 in their matrix representations in the computational basis:
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\ket{\psi}\leftrightarrow\left[\begin{array}{c}
1\\
0
\end{array}\right];\qquad\mathbf{Z}\leftrightarrow\left[\begin{array}{cc}
1 & 0\\
0 & -1
\end{array}\right]
\]

\end_inset

Thus:
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
\braket{\mathbf{Z}} & =\left[\begin{array}{cc}
1 & 0\end{array}\right]\left[\begin{array}{cc}
1 & 0\\
0 & -1
\end{array}\right]\left[\begin{array}{c}
1\\
0
\end{array}\right]=1
\end{align*}

\end_inset

#+html:
 </details>
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
\begin_inset Formula $\ket{\psi}=\ket{1}$
\end_inset


\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset

#+html:
 <details><summary>Show/hide solution...</summary>We write 
\begin_inset Formula $\ket{\psi}$
\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset Formula $\mathbf{Z}$
\end_inset

 in their matrix representations in the computational basis:
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\ket{\psi}\leftrightarrow\left[\begin{array}{c}
0\\
1
\end{array}\right];\qquad\mathbf{Z}\leftrightarrow\left[\begin{array}{cc}
1 & 0\\
0 & -1
\end{array}\right]
\]

\end_inset

Thus:
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
\braket{\mathbf{Z}} & =\left[\begin{array}{cc}
0 & 1\end{array}\right]\left[\begin{array}{cc}
1 & 0\\
0 & -1
\end{array}\right]\left[\begin{array}{c}
0\\
1
\end{array}\right]=-1
\end{align*}

\end_inset

